# Ask Compass live mode.
#
# With no key set, the prototype answers from its prepared responses and every
# view still works. Set a key to have Ask Compass call the model for real.
#
# Add this in Vercel under Settings > Environment Variables, and locally in a
# .env.local file (which is gitignored). Never commit a real key.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional. Defaults to claude-haiku-4-5: fast and cheap, which suits short
# grounded answers. Swap to claude-sonnet-4-5 for richer prose at more cost.
# COMPASS_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5

# Optional. Total live answers allowed per day across all visitors, as a cost
# ceiling on a public demo link. Defaults to 200.
# COMPASS_DAILY_MAX=200
